@dr_cintas The best way is to create a file: "~/.claude/settings-ollama.json", with content:

{
  "env": {
    "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "http://localhost:11434/",
    "ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN": "ollama",
    "ANTHROPIC_MODEL": "qwen2.5-coder:7b",
  }
}
